    "https://jobs.ferris.edu/en-us/job/498281/financial-aid-office-assistant-student-position": {
      "title": "Financial Aid Office Assistant (Student Position)",
      "description": "Financial Aid Office Assistant (Student Position) Apply now Job no: 498281 Work type: Student Employment - General Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Categories: Student Employment - General Position Title: Financial Aid Office Assistant (Student Position) Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Department: 61- Enrollment Services Advertised Salary: $13.73 - $13.99 Summary of Position: Are you a freshman or sophomore that is looking for a job on campus? If so, the Financial Aid Office is looking for an assistant. They will provide you with all the appropriate training so that you can grow in their office. Position Requirements: *Document imaging *Accurate data entry *Photocopying *Front desk coverage to assist students and guests regarding financial aid processes *Occasionally may represent the Financial Aid Office with other staff members at on-campus events Essential Duties/Responsibilities: *Document imaging *Accurate data entry *Photocopying *Front desk coverage to assist students and guests regarding financial aid processes *Occasionally may represent the Financial Aid Office with other staff members at on-campus events Number of Positions Available: 1 Documents Needed to Apply: Resume/ Class Schedule Job Close Date: October 21, 2026 EEO Statement: Ferris State University, an Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to cultivating an environment of belonging that values, respects, supports, and celebrates individual similarities and differences within its community, allowing students, faculty, and staff to thrive authentically. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence. Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at ferris.edu . For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit: Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement . Advertised: 30 Sep 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 21 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
