      "title": "Digital Media Assistant (Student Position)",
      "description": "Digital Media Assistant (Student Position) Apply now Job no: 498185 Work type: Student Employment - General Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Categories: Student Employment - General Position Title: Digital Media Research Assistant (Student Position) Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Department: College of Business Advertised Salary: $14.00 - $14.49 Summary of Position: Do you enjoy conducting research on topics regarding the career you are pursuing? If so, this assistant position may be your opportunity to gain more knowledge and experience within your future career. Position Requirements: *Must have a good understanding of the subject matter that is to be researched *Able to complete more intensive work assignments *Possess advances qualifications of this position Essential Duties/Responsibilities: *Data collection and management *Using database and spreadsheet programs *Decision-making on issues relevant to data collection Number of Positions Available: 5 Documents Needed to Apply: Resume, Class Schedule Job Close Date: December 12, 2026 EEO Statement: Ferris State University, an Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to cultivating an environment of belonging that values, respects, supports, and celebrates individual similarities and differences within its community, allowing students, faculty, and staff to thrive authentically. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, collaboration, diversity and educational excellence. Learn more about the Ferris Mission and community at ferris.edu . For more information on the University’s Policy on Non-Discrimination, visit: Ferris Non-Discrimination Statement . Advertised: 28 Aug 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 12 Dec 2026 Eastern Standard Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
