    "https://jobs.ferris.edu/en-us/job/498032/dining-student-manager-wink-ice-arena-student-position": {
      "title": "Dining Student Manager Wink Ice Arena (Student Position)",
      "description": "Dining Student Manager Wink Ice Arena (Student Position) Apply now Job no: 498032 Work type: Student Employment - General Location: Big Rapids, MI 49307 Categories: Student Employment - General Position Title: Dining Service Student Manager - Wink Ice Arena (Student Position) Location: Big Rapids, MI Department: 51- Aux Advertised Salary: $14.00 - $14.49 Summary of Position: Do you have prior experience working in on-campus dining units and are familiar with the jobs, policies, and procedures within the dining areas? If so, then this position may be for you. Position Requirements: *Be able to handle managing employees, caring for customers, and ensuring food service best practices with little supervision. *Student managers will track and administer progressive discipline and training records for a unit’s student employees in cooperation with the management team. *Students in the position must complete any required training, including but not limited to alcohol server training if supervising locations where alcohol is served. Essential Duties/Responsibilities: * Responsibilities include following all university policies that support an inclusive and diverse workplace and the recording information for departmental reports. * This position also works with departmental online tools and programs, such as the dining food management system, When2Work and Microsoft Office Suites. * Other duties as assigned. Number of Positions Available: 4 Documents Needed to Apply: Resume/ Class Schedule Job Close Date: December 31, 2026 EEO Statement: Ferris State University, an Equal Opportunity employer, is committed to cultivating an environment of belonging that values, respects, supports, and celebrates individual similarities and differences within its community, allowing students, faculty, and staff to thrive authentically. Ferris offers employment opportunities to qualified candidates seeking careers in a student-focused environment that values opportunity, c